#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:230
msgid "with tax authorities, regulators, courts, the police and others when the law requires it, or to protect the rights, property or safety of our customers, others or us;"
msgstr "ar nodokļu iestādēm, regulatoriem, tiesām, policiju un citiem, ja to prasa likums vai lai aizsargātu mūsu klientu, citu personu vai mūsu tiesības, īpašumu vai drošību;"

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:231
