# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:305
msgid "Complaints"
msgstr "Sūdzības"

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:306
msgid "If you are unhappy with how we handle your personal information, including our use of automated tools such as AI, please contact us first so we can try to put it right. Tell us what happened and what you would like us to do. We will acknowledge your complaint, look into it promptly and fairly, and tell you the outcome and what we will do about it."
msgstr "Ja jūs neapmierina tas, kā mēs apstrādājam jūsu personas datus, tostarp mūsu automatizēto rīku, piemēram, MI, izmantošana, lūdzu, vispirms sazinieties ar mums, lai mēs varētu mēģināt to labot. Pastāstiet, kas notika un ko vēlaties, lai mēs darām. Mēs apstiprināsim jūsu sūdzības saņemšanu, izskatīsim to nekavējoties un taisnīgi un paziņosim jums rezultātu un to, ko mēs darīsim."

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:308
